{"id":"n1-164","title":"Verbる にとどまらず～も","romaji":"Verb-ru ni todomarazu ~ mo","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'not only… but also', 'not limited to…'.","longExplanation":"にとどまらず is used to indicate that something goes beyond just the stated verb or noun. It can be translated as 'not just… but also…' or 'not limited to…'.","formation":"Noun / Verb-dictionary form + にとどまらず + も/ほかのこと","examples":[{"jp":"彼は仕事にとどまらず、ボランティア活動もしている。","romaji":"Kare wa shigoto ni todomarazu, borantia katsudou mo shite iru.","en":"He does not just work; he also does volunteer activities.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"とどまら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"とどまる"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ボランティア","vocabId":null},{"surface":"活動","vocabId":"1208360","reading":"かつどう"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,9]},{"jp":"この機能は写真撮影にとどまらず、動画撮影も可能です。","romaji":"Kono kinou wa shashin satsuei ni todomarazu, douga satsuei mo kanou desu.","en":"This function is not limited to taking photos; it can also record videos.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"機能","vocabId":"1221130","reading":"きのう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"写真","vocabId":"1321900","reading":"しゃしん"},{"surface":"撮影","vocabId":"1298800","reading":"さつえい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"とどまら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"とどまる"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"動画","vocabId":"1451290","reading":"どうが"},{"surface":"撮影","vocabId":"1298800","reading":"さつえい"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"可能","vocabId":"1191060","reading":"か